## 📦 5. Production Theme Packaging & ZIP Exporter
Package the full theme into an official Shopify-compatible `.zip` archive ready for `Themes > Upload zip`:
1. **Archive Directory Hierarchy**:
   - `layout/`: `theme.liquid`, `password.liquid`
   - `templates/`: synthesized `index.json`, `product.json`, `cart.json`, etc.
   - `blocks/`: all modular Tinker blocks (`*.liquid`)
   - `sections/`: base sections (`*.liquid`)
   - `snippets/`: supporting snippets (`*.liquid`)
   - `assets/`: compiled JS, CSS, SVG icons
   - `config/`: `settings_data.json` (with store name, Open Design color palette injected) and `settings_schema.json`
   - `locales/`: default `en.default.json` + internationalization bundles.
2. **FastAPI ZIP Streaming**:
   - Return raw `Response(content=zip_bytes, media_type="application/zip")` with `Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="<store>_shopify_theme.zip"` for zero-dependency 1-click browser downloads.
3. **Deterministic Non-Destructive Packaging Invariant**:
   - Never run shell commands with `-delete` (e.g. `find ... -delete`) or `rm -rf` during zip packaging pipelines (which trigger security prompt timeouts in agent runners).
   - Package programmatically in Python (`zipfile.ZipFile`) with strict directory whitelisting (`assets`, `blocks`, `config`, `layout`, `locales`, `sections`, `snippets`, `templates`), filtering out hidden files/dirs (`.git`, `.DS_Store`, `.vscode`) and development scripts (`.py`, `.sh`) on write.
4. **Canonical End-to-End Refactor & Packaging CLI (`theme_refactor_pipeline.py`)**:
   - Execute `python3 scripts/system/theme_refactor_pipeline.py all` to automate dual-directory synchronization (`DNK-e.com` ➔ `DNK_Horizon_Tinker`), JS license sanitization, `mega_component_registry.json` extraction, Packet 1-4 validation gates, and deterministic clean release ZIP generation (`DNK_Horizon_Tinker_Theme_v1.0.0.zip`).
   - Detailed architecture and CLI subcommands: see `references/canonical_theme_refactor_pipeline.md`.
5. **Pre-Packaging Schema Validation & Theme Access Headless Sync Protocol**:
   - Run `python3 scripts/validate_template_schemas.py --theme-dir <path> --fix` to catch and auto-clamp schema range boundary violations (e.g. `speed > 5`), preventing Shopify's cloud ZIP ingestion parser from silently dropping templates.
   - For headless deployment and exact HTTP 422 error unmasking, use Shopify's Theme Access API (`https://theme-kit-access.shopifyapps.com/cli/admin/api/unstable/themes/<id>/assets.json`) with headers `X-Shopify-Shop` and `X-Shopify-Access-Token` to inspect, upload, and verify templates directly without manual ZIP uploads. Detailed protocol: see `references/shopify_homepage_redirect_and_404_troubleshooting.md` (Sections 20 & 21).
6. **Mandatory Unambiguous Release Versioning & Customizer Sync Invariant**:
   - **Never Reuse Identical ZIP Filenames**: When delivering bugfixes for manual upload via `Themes > Add theme > Upload zip`, always increment the ZIP filename with an explicit version and descriptor (e.g. `Story 4.0.1 DNK Fixed Locales.zip`). Shopify Admin creates a separate new draft theme row on every zip upload rather than replacing the active or previously edited draft ID.
   - **Bump Manifest Metadata**: Always update `theme_name` and `theme_version` in `config/settings_schema.json` (e.g. `"Story 4.0.1 DNK"`, `"4.0.1"`). This visually brands the new entry in the Theme Library and top bar of the Theme Customizer, preventing the merchant from unknowingly remaining on an old broken draft ID.
   - **Pre-Packaging Hygiene**: Strip `.DS_Store`, `._*`, and temporary files before creating the archive. Remind the user to open `Customize` specifically on the newly created theme row.
7. **AI Template Validation, Raw Wrapping & Delta Patching Architecture**:
   - For pre-export referential integrity gates (asserting all `templates/*.json` section types match physical `sections/*.liquid` files), raw wrapping for LLM-generated double braces, and scoped delta patch operations (`PatchOperation`), see `references/ai_template_builder_validation_and_patching_patterns.md`.
8. **One-Shot Commercial Theme ZIP Forensic Audit & De-Branding (`audit_commercial_theme_zip.py`)**:
